    description: "Split from WI-tovap during the 2026-07-12 Wave-4 triage (WI-tovap's doc-drift face closed; this producer face is distinct and still live). The top-level features[] array holds 16 entries against 8 http_route entrypoints: 8 RICH handler-keyed features (node_count 5-17, edge_count 4-19) PLUS 8 DEGENERATE route-synthetic features (the :route registration nodes, ALL node_count=1, edge_count=0, zero behavioral info), all first-class entries with distinct ids. A consumer iterating features double-counts each route and must filter out the content-free twins -- half the inventory is empty. Fix shape: suppress the degenerate route-synthetic feature entries at the producer (or fold them into their rich handler sibling), OR document them as intentional index rows. Blind-severity-derived priority P2."  # d3d3
