  message: "Fixed in PR #596 (selfh dev 276e096ca6). _emit_handler_slices now excludes a degenerate route marker (framework_role=route, forward slice recovers nothing beyond itself) from behavior_map['features'] -- it was a content-free twin of the real concept-handler feature (self-analysis: 16 features for 8 routes = 8 rich + 8 empty node_count=1 twins). Fix is scoped to the features[] array; the per-slice file + index entry are still written so the marker stays discoverable. Real concept handlers unaffected even when trivial. Documented in spec features[] Producer section; test asserts marker excluded from features[] while its slice file is written. Wave-4 contract-accuracy (split from WI-tovap, fixed same session per owner 'fix now')."  # 0348
